# Hexhaven Dueling Arena: "{2}, {T}: Target creature that attacked this turn becomes prepared. Activate only as a
# sorcery" and "{4}, {T}: Target creature becomes prepared" (CR 722.3a, 508.1). Bot1 attacks with Bloodline Recollector
# and prepares it after combat with the first, then casts the copy of Ancestral Craving, which unprepares it. On its next
# turn, before any attack, the first ability is not offered (the Recollector has not attacked this turn, so it has no
# legal target); the second prepares it again.

